# Left out of the dbt image's GCP build (semantic/PLAN.md SL-19), passed to `uv pip compile --excludes`.
# dbt-bigquery requires them for what this project never runs: Vertex AI for Python models and BigFrames (imported
# only when one runs), pandas and pyarrow for google-cloud-bigquery's DataFrame reads (dbt and MetricFlow read rows).
# Together about half the image as Artifact Registry stores it (270 to 149 MiB, #206); `make gcp-image-check` runs
# the image's dbt build and MetricFlow without them.
google-cloud-aiplatform
pandas-gbq
db-dtypes
pandas
pyarrow
